PUSHBUTTON DEBOUNCING USING INTERRUPT:

    ->This is a simulation using wokwi with ESP32 by Espressif.

    ->This is a simple debouncing circuit that counts the number of times a button is pressed and display the count on an LCD screen bu using the LiquidCrystal.h library

